        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Courier arrives at store; Stock Associate verifies courier identity (OTP from platform); hands over packaged order with delivery manifest; captures handover timestamp
Responsible (R): Stock Associate
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W668_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W668_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
