Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W668_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W668_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W668_Task14" name="Upon delivery: courier captures proof-of-delivery (photo + e-signature); system…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Upon delivery: courier captures proof-of-delivery (photo + e-signature); system updates order status; triggers revenue recognition
Responsible (R): System / Courier
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W668_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W668_Flow28</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W668_Task15" name="For failed deliveries: system auto-reschedules within 48 hours…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: For failed deliveries: system auto-reschedules within 48 hours; perishable/sensitive items returned to store inventory
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W668_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W668_Flow29</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W668_Task16" name="Weekly: Store Manager reviews delivery SLA compliance (on-time %, damage rate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 10: Weekly: Store Manager reviews delivery SLA compliance (on-time %, damage rate, customer satisfaction per delivery CSAT survey); escalates underperforming couriers to HQ logistics team per W242
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): Regional Manager
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
