    <bpmn:process id="W_W1424" name="W1424. Store-Level DSD Vendor Delivery Performance Monitoring, Scorecard &amp; Compliance Tracking" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Weekly DSD performance review cycle; or monthly vendor scorecard generation; or delivery exception event (late delivery, short shipment, quality rejection)
Frequency: Weekly exception review; monthly vendor scorecard generation; ongoing per-delivery event logging
Volume: ~500–600 DSD receipts/month across 200 stores (~3 DSD deliveries/store/month); ~50–80 DSD vendors (cement, lumber, sand, gravel, heavy/bulky items)
Owner: Supply Planning Manager
Participants: Supply Planning Manager, Store Manager, Receiving Clerk, Category Manager, Buyer, Vendor Account Manager
Source: workflow W1424 — Store-Level DSD Vendor Delivery Performance Monitoring, Scorecard &amp; Compliance Tracking</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1424_LaneSet6">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1424_Lane1" name="Receiving Clerk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1424_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1424_Start7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1424_Lane2" name="Supply Planning Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1424_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1424_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1424_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1424_Lane4" name="Category Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1424_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1424_Lane5" name="VP Supply Chain">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1424_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1424_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1424_Start7" name="Weekly DSD performance review cycle; or monthly vendor scorecard generation; or delivery…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1424_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1424_Task8" name="Per-delivery event logging">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Per-delivery event logging: Store Receiving Clerk logs DSD delivery details at goods receipt per W18: (a) delivery vs. PO: (i) on-time (within scheduled delivery window per W745), (ii) late (delivered after window), (iii) early/unannounced (arrived without appointment), (b) quantity accuracy: (i) full delivery (all PO lines received in full), (ii) short shipment (partial delivery), (iii) over-shipment (vendor delivered more than ordered), (c) quality: (i) accepted (no issues), (ii) partial rejection (some items damaged/defective), (iii) full rejection (entire delivery rejected — quality or wrong items), (d) documentation: (i) delivery receipt signed, (ii) truck photos (for damage claims), (iii) discrepancy report filed
Responsible (R): Receiving Clerk
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 5–10 min/delivery (absorbed in W18)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1424_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1424_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1424_Task9" name="Weekly exception review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Weekly exception review: Supply Planning Manager reviews weekly DSD exception report: (a) late deliveries: which vendors are consistently late? (threshold: &gt; 20% of deliveries late in the week), (b) short shipments: which vendors are short-shipping? impact on store availability, (c) quality rejections: which vendors have quality issues? what categories are affected? (d) for each exception: Store Manager provides context (vendor communication, local issues)
Responsible (R): Supply Planning Manager
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: 1–2 hours/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1424_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1424_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1424_Task10" name="Monthly vendor scorecard generation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Monthly vendor scorecard generation: System generates monthly DSD vendor scorecard: (a) on-time delivery rate (% of deliveries within scheduled window), (b) fill rate (% of ordered quantity delivered), (c) quality acceptance rate (% of deliveries accepted without rejection), (d) invoice accuracy rate (% of DSD invoices matching PO + GR without discrepancy), (e) overall score: weighted average (on-time 40%, fill rate 30%, quality 20%, invoice accuracy 10%), (f) trend: vs. prior month, vs. same month last year, (g) flag: vendors scoring below 80% overall
Responsible (R): System / Supply Planning Manager
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: 2–3 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1424_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1424_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1424_Task11" name="Vendor performance review meeting">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Vendor performance review meeting: Category Manager and Buyer meet with underperforming DSD vendors (score &lt; 80%): (a) present scorecard with specific delivery exceptions, (b) require vendor corrective action plan: (i) root cause for late deliveries (truck availability, scheduling, distance), (ii) root cause for short shipments (production capacity, driver theft), (iii) root cause for quality issues (packaging, handling, storage), (c) set improvement targets: vendor must achieve 85% score within 60 days or face volume reduction, (d) for chronic underperformers: evaluate alternative DSD vendor per W34 (vendor sourcing)
Responsible (R): Category Manager / Buyer
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 2–3 hours/vendor review</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1424_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1424_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1424_Task12" name="Annual DSD vendor rationalization">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Annual DSD vendor rationalization: annually, VP Supply Chain and VP Merchandising review DSD vendor portfolio: (a) total DSD spend by vendor, (b) performance trend (improving/stable/declining), (c) cost comparison: DSD vs. DC-handled (for items that could go either way), (d) vendor consolidation opportunities (reduce from 50–80 DSD vendors to fewer, more reliable partners), (e) terminate underperforming vendors and onboard replacements per W34
Responsible (R): VP Supply Chain / VP Merchandising
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 1–2 days/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1424_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1424_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1424_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1424_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1424_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-261 (ensure controlled execution — Store Receiving &amp; Replenishment (PA-07.3).) | - operational: Supply Planning Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Supply Planning Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1424_Assoc15" sourceRef="W1424_Annotation14" targetRef="W1424_Start7" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1424_Flow16" sourceRef="W1424_Start7" targetRef="W1424_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1424_Flow17" sourceRef="W1424_Task8" targetRef="W1424_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1424_Flow18" sourceRef="W1424_Task9" targetRef="W1424_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1424_Flow19" sourceRef="W1424_Task10" targetRef="W1424_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1424_Flow20" sourceRef="W1424_Task11" targetRef="W1424_Task12" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1424_Flow21" sourceRef="W1424_Task12" targetRef="W1424_End13" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W1424_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W1424_plane" bpmnElement="W_W1424">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1424_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W1424_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1370" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1424_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W1424_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="1370" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1424_Lane3_di" bpmnElement="W1424_Lane3" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="420" width="1370" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1424_Lane4_di" bpmnElement="W1424_Lane4" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="590" width="1370" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
